{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">澳門傍晚六時改發三號風球。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨著紅霞靠近，澳門部分地區下午開始下雨，當局發出黃色暴雨警告。氣象局預料，明日凌晨至早上改發八號風球可能性，是較低至中等，需要發出藍色風暴潮警告可能性較低。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.M.TYPHOON-1800_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20263VcpxNO4op1784979314.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.M.TYPHOON-1800_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T11:43:55.034198+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}